#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:5 src/en/contribute/index.md:1
#: src/en/index.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contribute"
msgstr "Beitragen"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:11
msgid ""
"We are happy to see you contribute to Zammad! You can do this in several "
"ways. Contributions are mainly done by forking one of our repos on GitHub "
"and creating a pull request with your changes (except for translations, see "
"below). 🚀"
msgstr ""
"Wir freuen uns, wenn Sie zu Zammad beitragen! Sie können dies auf "
"verschiedene Arten tun. Sie können beitragen, indem Sie eines unserer Repos "
"auf GitHub forken und einen Pull Request mit Ihren Änderungen erstellen "
"(außer für Übersetzungen, siehe unten). 🚀"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can contribute to:\n"
" * [Source-code](contribute#zammad-source-code)\n"
" * [Documentation](contribute#documentation)\n"
" * [Translation](contribute#translation)\n"
msgstr ""
"Sie können dazu beitragen:\n"
" * [Quellcode]contribute#zammad-source-code)\n"
" * [Dokumentation](contribute#documentation)\n"
" * [Übersetzung](contribute#translation)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:18
msgid "Please have a look on our notes on how to contribute below."
msgstr "Bitte sehen Sie sich unsere Hinweise für Beiträge an."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:20
msgid "All repos can be found on [Github](https://github.com/zammad)."
msgstr "Alle Repos sind auf [Github](https://github.com/zammad) zu finden."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Zammad Source Code"
msgstr "Zammad Quellcode"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:25
msgid ""
"The Zammad source code can be found on GitHub in the [Zammad repository]"
"(https://github.com/zammad/zammad)."
msgstr ""
"Der Quellcode von Zammad ist auf GitHub im [Zammad Repository] (https://"
"github.com/zammad/zammad) zu finden."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:27
msgid ""
"Have a look at the [developer manual](https://github.com/zammad/zammad/blob/"
"develop/doc/developer_manual/index.md) to get started."
msgstr ""
"Werfen Sie einen Blick in das [Entwicklerhandbuch] (https://github.com/"
"zammad/zammad/blob/develop/doc/developer_manual/index.md), um loszulegen."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported Branches / Versions"
msgstr "Unterstützte Branches / Versionen"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:32
msgid ""
"The main [Zammad repository](https://github.com/zammad/zammad) at Github has "
"several branches."
msgstr ""
"Das Haupt-[Zammad-Repository] (https://github.com/zammad/zammad) auf Github "
"hat mehrere Branches."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "``develop``"
msgstr "``develop``"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:39
msgid ""
"This is the current (unreleased) development state of next major release "
"(this will become the new ``stable`` branch)."
msgstr ""
"Dies ist der aktuelle (unveröffentlichte) Entwicklungsstand der nächsten "
"Hauptversion (dieser wird zum neuen ``stable``-Branch)."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:39
msgid "Don't use it for production!"
msgstr "Verwenden Sie das nicht für den Produktiv-Betrieb!"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:39 src/en/contribute/contribute.md:45
msgid ""
"Supported with bug and security fixes - see also our [Security Policy]"
"(https://github.com/zammad/zammad/blob/develop/SECURITY.md)."
msgstr ""
"Unterstützt durch Fehler- und Sicherheitskorrekturen - siehe auch unsere "
"[Security Policy] (https://github.com/zammad/zammad/blob/develop/SECURITY."
"md)."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "``stable``"
msgstr "``stable``"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:45
msgid "This is the current stable release, e.g. Zammad 5.2."
msgstr "Dies ist die aktuelle stabile Version, z.B. Zammad 5.2."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:45
msgid "Use this branch for production installations."
msgstr "Verwenden Sie diese für den Produktiv-Betrieb."

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "``stable-x.y``"
msgstr "``stable-x.y``"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:51
msgid ""
"These are the branches of old versions of Zammad like ``stable-5.1`` for "
"Zammad 5.1."
msgstr ""
"Dies sind Branches von alten Versionen von Zammad wie ``stable-5.1`` für "
"Zammad 5.1."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:51
msgid "No support for bug or security issues is provided."
msgstr "Keine Unterstützung durch Fehler- oder Sicherheitskorrekturen."

