msgstr "Safari 14.1+"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/prerequisites.md:49
msgid ""
"The communication between client and server is based on web sockets. Some "
"firewalls may filter these connections. This may lead to decreased browser "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"Die Kommunikation zwischen Client und Server erfolgt über Web-Sockets. "
"Einige Firewalls können diese Verbindungen filtern. Dies kann zu einer "
"reduzierten Browserleistung führen."

